stemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布自主智能体Dots与企业应用市场，ChatGPT转型软件分发平台</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD以82亿美元全股票收购World Labs，李飞飞出任执行副总裁兼首席科学家</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯入局Personal Agent赛道，代号Handy Bot的个人智能体已在微信低调内测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9dbda58b580eb11e1a27f620119fa313.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正在秘密开发代号为&quot;Handy Bot&quot;的Personal Agent产品，目前已在微信端低调上线服务号进行内测，并计划推出独立App。该产品定位为&quot;Your Personal AI Agent&quot;，与传统Chatbot的一问一答模式不同，Handy Bot追求常驻后台，用户仅需提供宏观目标，AI即可在云端持续推进任务，无需人类逐条指令干预。其核心逻辑与Meta的Muse类似，旨在通过独立安全虚拟机处理比价购物、邮件处理及行程盯守等生活琐事。当前行业正处于Personal Agent的竞争窗口期，阿里正推动千问向具备个人上下文记忆的&quot;我的千问&quot;演进，字节跳动也在开发代号&quot;Spell&quot;的个人助理。Handy Bot目前仍处于内部测试阶段，产品细节尚未最终定型。该赛道的落地关键在于平衡模型任务规划能力、生态工具开</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉获300亿美元新增信贷额度，加速Cybercab与Optimus量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0b05623cc8b98f58a8a45098b8aca1ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉已敲定总额300亿美元的新增信贷额度，旨在全面支持Cybercab无人驾驶出租车、Optimus人形机器人及Tesla Semi卡车的规模化研发与量产建设。该融资由多家金融机构承接，包括花旗银行提供的200亿美元三年期延期提取定期贷款，以及富国银行牵头的80亿美元五年期和20亿美元一年期循环信贷协议。特斯拉在监管文件中表示，今年内暂无动用计划。截至2026年第二季度末，特斯拉现金及投资储备超400亿美元，负债约90亿美元，预计全年资本支出至少达250亿美元。目前，Semi与Optimus正采取建设专用独立工厂的重资产路径，此次巨额流动性储备将作为工业级硬件制造的资本底座，为后续产能爬坡及商业化落地提供抗风险缓冲，标志着特斯拉从算法验证向大规模制造阶段的战略转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布自主智能体Dots与企业应用市场，ChatGPT转型软件分发平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7eab8cf1a7b9a8765f273deeaef28ea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI在开发者日推出自主AI智能体“Dots”及企业应用市场，将ChatGPT重塑为集发现、调用与运行于一体的综合分发平台。Dots配备专属云端计算机与浏览器，打通超4000个应用生态，支持在用户授权下跨应用执行建站、排会及Bug修复等复杂任务，实现从“搜索-下载”到“意图驱动”的交互范式转变。ChatGPT现支持内嵌Figma、Adobe等第三方应用交互面板，并推出“使用ChatGPT登录”系统，首批接入Devin、Notion、Vercel等16家平台。企业应用市场已汇聚Salesforce、HubSpot等30余家合作伙伴，支持OpenAI额度抵扣软件费用。OpenAI通过统一身份层与重构软件发现机制，实质性搭建起绕开传统应用商店的AI原生分发网络，并升级开发者服务基础设施，支持实时追踪审核进度与局</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD以82亿美元全股票收购World Labs，李飞飞出任执行副总裁兼首席科学家</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/117f80e4b1094a3672b622b60dd3ad22.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD于9月28日宣布以82亿美元全股票交易收购初创公司World Labs，World Labs联合创始人李飞飞将加入AMD担任执行副总裁兼首席科学家，直接向CEO苏姿丰汇报。World Labs由李飞飞于2024年创立，专注于“世界模型”技术，旨在通过文本、图像和视频生成可交互的3D环境，应用于机器人训练、工厂模拟及科学研究。其近期推出的Atlas模型，能够仅凭少量2D图像预测不同视角下的场景画面，其逻辑类似于LLM预测序列中的下一个词，但在视觉几何领域预测下一帧视角。此次收购标志着AMD正从芯片硬件向AI模型演进路径深度布局，通过引入世界模型核心技术，旨在优化计算系统架构，为下一代AI计算提供更精准的硬件支撑。李飞飞此前曾创建ImageNet数据库，并担任谷歌云AI首席科学家及斯坦福大学以人为本AI研究院</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
